  "description": "A long time ago, Zeus, the great god, created a three&ndash;tier hierarchy of angels, top, middle and lower, although they were supposed to be equal. Also, Zeus appointed 6 angels as Saint Beasts who govern the animals of Earth. They were: Go, the seiyu; Shin, the genbu; Rei, the suzaku; Guy, the byakko; Yuda, the kirin; and Ruka, the hooh. However, Kira, the shooting star, and Maya, the fuga, didn&rsquo;t attend the selection tests and left for the Earth.<br><br>\nThe six angels fulfilled their tasks faithfully. However, because of Zeus&rsquo;s increasingly tyrannical acts, they begin to mistrust him.<br><br>\n(Source: AnimeNfo)",
